OL,3,AMinister says 32 UK government services
OL,4,Aunavailable due to global
OL,5,Acyber-security issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FA UK minister says 32 government
OL,8,Fservices are unavailable and four
OL,9,Fpartially unavailable due to a global
OL,10,Fcyber-security issue
OL,12,FThere are no known breaches in the UK
OL,13,Fand "no large public-facing critical
OL,14,Fservices are being affected", the
OL,15,Fgovernment says, but some "limited
OL,16,Fservices may temporarily be offline" to
OL,17,Fapply fixes
OL,19,FAround the world, organisations are
OL,20,Fscrambling to fix the security flaw -
OL,21,Four cyber correspondent explains how AI
OL,22,Fwas used to find the problem
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
