OL,5,Acyber-security issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe vulnerability is within the PHP
OL,8,Fprogramming language, which collects
OL,9,Finformation you need and presents it in
OL,10,Fa way you can read on the web. Here's a
OL,11,Ftimeline of how the saga unfolded
OL,13,FA researcher who helped to identify the
OL,14,Fflaw says it is "the most serious"
OL,15,Fissue he has ever found
OL,17,FInternet infrastructure platform
OL,18,FCloudflare says it saw "millions" of
OL,19,Fhacking attempts on its network - but
OL,20,Fthere's no evidence that these were
OL,21,Fsuccessful
